# @import ./keycloak.http
# Notification service (port 3004): a WebSocket at /ws plus a health check.
@notify = http://localhost:3004

### Health: how many sockets this instance holds
GET {{notify}}/health

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.status == ok

### Open the socket and sign in; then make a video READY and watch for video.ready / video.published
# @ref token
WS ws://localhost:3004/ws

{ "event": "auth", "data": { "token": "{{token.access_token}}" } }
